## Acknowledgments

### Open Source Projects

This project stands on the shoulders of giants. We acknowledge and thank the developers of:

- **YOLOv8** by [Ultralytics](https://www.ultralytics.com/)
  - Advanced real-time object detection
  - https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics

- **Tesseract OCR** by [Google](https://github.com/google/tesseract)
  - Optical character recognition

- **OpenCV** by the OpenCV Team
  - Computer vision library
  - https://opencv.org/

- **Qt Framework** by [Qt Company](https://www.qt.io/)
  - Cross-platform GUI development
  - https://github.com/qt/qt5

- **PyTorch** by [Meta AI](https://pytorch.org/)
  - Deep learning framework
  - https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch

- **Pandas** by the Pandas Development Team
  - Data analysis library
  - https://pandas.pydata.org/

- **NumPy** by the NumPy Developers
  - Numerical computing
  - https://numpy.org/

